                    Security GUIDE v0.1 coded by CøRteX/tRS¿
                   -========================================-

. [ INTRUDUCTION: ] .
---------------------

   I have seen many of Security Doors last times but this is one of the
   BEST and of course one of the FASTEST Security Doors for Ami-Express.

   For some good ideas for another Doors or an registered Version of this
   Door call my BBS under +43 512 365302. 

   But now enjoy this really fine door .... 

. [ Requirements: ] . 
---------------------

   All what you need is any Model of an Amiga OS2.0 or higher!
   AmiExpress 2.xx - 3.xx
   Thats all folks....

. [ INSTALLATION ] .
--------------------
   Copy the files in the archive to your directories,
   they are :                                        
                                                  
   BBS:Doors/SecurityGuide/SGFront.XiM
   BBS:Doors/SecurityGuide/SGMain.XiM              
   BBS:Doors/SecurityGuide/SecurityGuide.cfg
   BBS:Doors/SecurityGuide/SecurityGuide.Doc
   LIBS:AEDoor.library ( © Sintax/WOT )

   Start the SGfront.Xim door in your Logon.txt or Bull.txt

   Example of an Logon.txt:

------- Cut -------

    ~CC_SGFront

------- Cut -------

Example of an Config File:

  ;Security Guide v0.1 by CøRteX/tRSi!
#
250                        ;All Users over this SecLevel would be freezed down
100                        ;to this SecLevel!!!
#
CoRteX                     ;1. (Co)SYSOPS Name
255                        ;= SecLevel, after he typed in his right Password
pass                       ;password for this (Co)Sysop
#
DJAX                       ;2.Sysop
250                        ;......
Heidi                      ;.....
#
Felon                      :3. ....
250
beer
##			   ;End Command



